---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Section from '../../components/layout/Section.astro';
import Container from '../../components/layout/Container.astro';

const lastUpdated = '2026-05-19';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="Pitot Logic privacy policy — what we collect, what we don't, and how we handle data on the marketing site and inside Runway."
  noindex
>
  <Section tone="paper">
    <Container width="narrow">
      <article class="doc stack-l">
        <header>
          <p class="eyebrow">Legal · Privacy</p>
          <h1 class="display step-4">Privacy policy</h1>
          <p class="updated">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
        </header>

        <section>
          <h2>The short version</h2>
          <p>
            On <strong>pitotlogic.com</strong>, we collect the email address you provide on the
            waitlist form and any optional context you add in the message field. We store it on
            Cloudflare KV. We use it to contact you about Runway and nothing else.
          </p>
          <p>
            Inside <strong>Runway</strong> (the product), data lives in your Microsoft tenant —
            documents in your SharePoint, identities in your Entra directory, calendar events in
            the organizer's mailbox. Pitot Logic stores application records (risks, issues,
            tasks, etc.) in a Microsoft Azure SQL database that's scoped to your tenant.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>What we collect on this site</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Email address (when you submit the waitlist form)</li>
            <li>Optional message text (when you submit the contact form)</li>
            <li>Source (which form you used)</li>
            <li>Timestamp and user-agent string (for diagnostic purposes)</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>What we don't collect</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Third-party analytics with cross-site tracking</li>
            <li>Marketing cookies</li>
            <li>Session replay</li>
            <li>Anything from visitors who don't submit a form</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Hosting</h2>
          <p>
            This site is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. Form submissions are processed by a Cloudflare
            Pages Function and persisted to Cloudflare KV. Standard server logs are kept by
            Cloudflare per their data-retention policy.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Your rights</h2>
          <p>
            Email <a class="link" href="mailto:privacy@pitotlogic.com">privacy@pitotlogic.com</a>
            to request access to or deletion of any data we hold about you. We'll respond within
            30 days.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Contact</h2>
          <p>
            Pitot Logic LLC. For privacy questions:
            <a class="link" href="mailto:privacy@pitotlogic.com">privacy@pitotlogic.com</a>.
          </p>
        </section>
      </article>
    </Container>
  </Section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .step-4 { font-size: var(--step-4); }
  .doc { max-width: 42rem; }
  .updated { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--step--2); color: var(--ink-mute); margin-top: var(--space-2xs); }
  .doc section { margin-top: var(--space-l); }
  .doc h2 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--step-1); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: var(--space-s); }
  .doc p { color: var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom: var(--space-s); line-height: 1.6; }
  .doc ul { list-style: disc; padding-left: var(--space-l); color: var(--ink-soft); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-3xs); }
</style>
